Package: ha4fpai-control
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8)
Maintainer: WCIS <takomitkm@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: HA4FPAI unified control service (/v1)
 SQLite business store with versioned migrations, unified command pipeline
 with idempotency and confirmations, unified person identity, settings with
 revision fencing, event log, receipts ingest, media upload and task worker.
 Ships two systemd units (service + task worker). Units are NOT enabled
 automatically; start with systemctl enable --now ha4fpai-control
 ha4fpai-task-worker after reviewing docs/DEPLOY-CONTROL.md.
